  message: "Closure substrate + audit shipped via WI-hupaz (PR #3919, commit 128b44c737) + WI-dilab (PR #3921, commit 955ec5df7e). Pass.depends_on declared in CNF across all 57 linkers: 10 Bridge (anchor+impls), 29 Framework (single or multi-language), 11 Protocol (multi-language OR), 7 Infrastructure (6 with declarations + containment explicit empty + docstring). validate_pass_name_resolution catches typos at CI time; validate_pass_dependencies provides forward-looking runtime CNF gating. Full satisfaction requires Phase 2 wire-up of validate_pass_dependencies into run_behavior_map config-time pass filtering — separate future WI."  # db2b
