  message: "Cross-ref backfill (2026-05-30, theme 8): closure of this item (Pass.requires: list[str] — declare pass dependencies; pre-run validator catches missing prerequisites) is the schema-design correlate of INV-nanon-pavav-ragod-tunur-riroj-siraj-fugan-gotiz, the May-28 dogfood-66 umbrella 'META: Passes execute and consume resources but emit no edges, with no activation gate'. INV-nanon documents the observed scan-and-emit-nothing behavior; this item adds the dependency-declaration mechanism that would enable an activation gate. Closure enables — but doesn't itself fix — INV-nanon's violations."  # 0f1f
